{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Phenomena Embattled",
    "steam_appid": 2669030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669030/extras/624b0a1cf6d1526a9a23b48e5c242698.avif?t=1751010573\" width=616 height=291 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the far reaching void of space, to the very cores of planets. This is where <strong>Phenomena Embattled</strong> takes place. You are part of an alien confederation sent to earth to find the means of ending an intergalactic conflict. Humanity is caught between alien star-fleets. They must strive to keep their place in the universe. You must find the path to complete your mission.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a physics based shoot 'em up. Interact with squadrons and entire fleets in a story driven world. This single player narrative focuses on action rich, rouge-like, trans-medium combat. Be it air, water, or vacuum. The medium you steer your unexplained vehicle through will determine your capabilities. And the ones of your enemies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Physics based interactive environment </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Action driven missions and story </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Intelligent enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Formation flying </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ability leveling </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose your unexplained phenomenon </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 60+ base units to fight with and against </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Many unique undisclosed encounters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Underground bases </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Worlds beyond the solar system </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development. The demo offers introductory content which we are improving and expanding. Join, subscribe and follow our social channels for updates and news.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669030/extras/664b9dc396c6f2b3067d30d5aed009a1.poster.avif?t=1751010573\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669030/extras/664b9dc396c6f2b3067d30d5aed009a1.webm?t=1751010573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Squadrons stick together and try to out-maneuver you as a fleet. Choose your attack vector wisely: the squadron you are engaging might set you up for the backup fleet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669030/extras/0099f36eb871bee0ac13fbe6ccf77402.avif?t=1751010573\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Inhabitants of earth are dangerously close to discovering the true energies held within the planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669030/extras/4c198dc54d5b958e29a6f4ff3cafcc63.avif?t=1751010573\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is ancient. And so are the civilizations that know about it. Uncover their past doings, venture deep underground and set their power free again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The fate of Earth awaits your flying skill.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669030/extras/624b0a1cf6d1526a9a23b48e5c242698.avif?t=1751010573\" width=616 height=291 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the far reaching void of space, to the very cores of planets. This is where <strong>Phenomena Embattled</strong> takes place. You are part of an alien confederation sent to earth to find the means of ending an intergalactic conflict. Humanity is caught between alien star-fleets. They must strive to keep their place in the universe. You must find the path to complete your mission.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a physics based shoot 'em up. Interact with squadrons and entire fleets in a story driven world. This single player narrative focuses on action rich, rouge-like, trans-medium combat. Be it air, water, or vacuum. The medium you steer your unexplained vehicle through will determine your capabilities. And the ones of your enemies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Physics based interactive environment </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Action driven missions and story </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Intelligent enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Formation flying </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ability leveling </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose your unexplained phenomenon </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 60+ base units to fight with and against </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Many unique undisclosed encounters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Underground bases </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Worlds beyond the solar system </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development. The demo offers introductory content which we are improving and expanding. Join, subscribe and follow our social channels for updates and news.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669030/extras/664b9dc396c6f2b3067d30d5aed009a1.poster.avif?t=1751010573\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669030/extras/664b9dc396c6f2b3067d30d5aed009a1.webm?t=1751010573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Squadrons stick together and try to out-maneuver you as a fleet. Choose your attack vector wisely: the squadron you are engaging might set you up for the backup fleet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669030/extras/0099f36eb871bee0ac13fbe6ccf77402.avif?t=1751010573\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Inhabitants of earth are dangerously close to discovering the true energies held within the planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669030/extras/4c198dc54d5b958e29a6f4ff3cafcc63.avif?t=1751010573\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is ancient. And so are the civilizations that know about it. Uncover their past doings, venture deep underground and set their power free again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The fate of Earth awaits your flying skill.</i></p>",
